 exact ⟨⟨A0,B,F,G, SelectDoseN X k', SelectDoseN Y k', r,ε,p',v,W,a,b,Ho,L,T,J,DoseTravel.prescribed ..,DoseTravel.prescribed ..,σ,Hz,pc,pG,h⟩⟩
